(2, 5, "Aortal yetishmovchilik va aortal stenozni solishtirishda to‘g‘ri fikrlarni belgilang.",
 ["Yetishmovchilikda periferik pulsatsiyalar yaqqol", "Stenozda aortada sistolik “mushuk xirillashi”", "Yetishmovchilikda shovqin protodiastolik, cho‘qqiga tarqaladi", "Stenozda shovqin sistolik, uyqu arteriyalariga tarqaladi", "Ikkalasida ham aorta ustida II ton susaygan", "Stenozda puls tez va baland", "Yetishmovchilikda puls bosimi kichik", "Stenozda chap qorincha eksentrik dilatatsiyasi", "Yetishmovchilikda “mushuk xirillashi” aortada sistolik", "Stenozda Myusse belgisi yaqqol"],
 "Mark the correct statements comparing aortic regurgitation and stenosis.",
 ["Regurgitation — prominent peripheral pulsations", "Stenosis — systolic thrill over the aorta", "Regurgitation — early diastolic murmur radiating to the apex", "Stenosis — systolic murmur radiating to the carotids", "Both have a soft A2", "Stenosis — rapid high pulse", "Regurgitation — narrow pulse pressure", "Stenosis — eccentric LV dilatation", "Regurgitation — systolic thrill over the aorta", "Stenosis — prominent de Musset’s sign"],
 "Stenozda puls sekin va kichik, konsentrik gipertrofiya; yetishmovchilikda puls bosimi katta.",
 "Stenosis has a slow small pulse and concentric hypertrophy; regurgitation has a wide pulse pressure."),
