(3, 5, "Duke-ISCVID kichik mezonlarini belgilang.",
 ["Moyillik (oldin IE, sun’iy qopqoq, inyeksion giyohvandlik)", "Isitma 38,0 °C dan yuqori", "Tomir hodisalari (arterial emboliyalar, Janevey dog‘lari)", "Immun hodisalar (Osler tugunchalari, Rot dog‘lari, glomerulonefrit)", "Katta mezonga yetmaydigan musbat qon ekmasi", "Tipik mikroblarning 2 ta alohida qon ekmasida aniqlanishi", "ExoKG da vegetatsiya", "Operatsiyada IE ni bevosita ko‘rish", "Qopqoq teshilishi yoki absess", "Yangi ahamiyatli qopqoq regurgitatsiyasi (ExoKG)"],
 "Mark the Duke-ISCVID minor criteria.",
 ["Predisposition (prior IE, prosthetic valve, injection drug use)", "Fever above 38.0 °C", "Vascular phenomena (arterial emboli, Janeway lesions)", "Immunological phenomena (Osler’s nodes, Roth spots, glomerulonephritis)", "Positive blood culture not meeting a major criterion", "Typical organisms in 2 separate blood cultures", "Vegetation on echo", "Direct view of IE at surgery", "Valve perforation or abscess", "New significant regurgitation on echo"],
 "Qolganlari katta (mikrobiologik, tasvirlash, jarrohlik) mezonlar.",
 "The others are major (microbiological, imaging, surgical) criteria."),
(3, 5, "Infeksion endokardit asoratlarini belgilang.",
 ["Perivalvulyar absess va fistulalar", "Insult (markaziy asab tizimiga emboliya)", "Mikotik anevrizmalar", "Immun kompleksli glomerulonefrit", "Koronar emboliya va miokard infarkti", "Bronxial astma", "Gipotireoz", "Psoriaz", "Revmatoid artrit", "Bronxoektaz kasalligi"],
 "Mark the complications of infective endocarditis.",
 ["Perivalvular abscess and fistulae", "Stroke (CNS embolism)", "Mycotic aneurysms", "Immune-complex glomerulonephritis", "Coronary embolism and MI", "Bronchial asthma", "Hypothyroidism", "Psoriasis", "Rheumatoid arthritis", "Bronchiectasis"],
 "Shuningdek yurak yetishmovchiligi, AV blokada, sepsis va metastatik absesslar.",
 "Also heart failure, AV block, sepsis and metastatic abscesses."),
